<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sfornato Ora - Ostia | Il Canale del Viale</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }
        .glow-emerald {
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px -10px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between selection:bg-orange-500 selection:text-white antialiased">

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="w-full py-4 px-6 border-b border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/20">
                    🥐
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="font-black text-lg tracking-tight bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-400 via-amber-300 to-yellow-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Sfornato Ora</span>
                    <span class="block text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-semibold -mt-1 tracking-wide">OSTIA • IL CANALE DEL VIALE</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <a href="#whatsapp-box" class="text-xs font-bold px-3.5 py-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center gap-2 hover:bg-emerald-500/20 transition-all">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping"></span>
                <span>Canale Attivo</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-5 py-8 w-full space-y-10">
        
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="text-center space-y-5 pt-2">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 text-xs text-orange-400 font-bold tracking-wide">
                🔥 Il Canale WhatsApp di Quartiere Ad Ostia
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">
                Il meglio del viale,<br>
                <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-400 via-amber-300 to-yellow-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">fresco e all'ultimo prezzo.</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-lg mx-auto">
                Non lasciare che le eccellenze dei forni e delle pizzerie di Ostia vadano sprecate. Ricevi un avviso sul telefono appena ci sono offerte speciali e teglie sfornate nel pomeriggio.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Categorie nel Canale -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400 uppercase text-center">Cosa trovi ogni giorno sul canale</h2>
            <div class="grid gap-2.5">
                <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-3.5 flex items-center space-x-3 border-slate-800">
                    <span class="text-2xl">🍕</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-xs text-white">Pizzerie & Tavola Calda</h3>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Teglie calde nel pomeriggio e supplì a prezzo ribassato</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-3.5 flex items-center space-x-3 border-slate-800">
                    <span class="text-2xl">🥖</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-xs text-white">Forno & Pasticceria Artigianale</h3>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Pane fresco, pizzette e biscotti della tradizione sfornati in giornata</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- WhatsApp Central Box -->
        <section id="whatsapp-box" class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-emerald-950/50 border border-emerald-500/40 rounded-3xl p-7 text-center relative overflow-hidden glow-emerald space-y-4">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-3xl border border-emerald-500/30">
                💬
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-black text-xl text-white">Iscriviti Gratis al Canale WhatsApp</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-sm mx-auto">
                Nessun gruppo rumoroso: è un canale informativo anonimo. Ricevi la notifica, scendi in negozio e mostri l'avviso al banco.
            </p>
            <a href="https://whatsapp.com" target="_blank" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-extrabold py-4 px-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl shadow-emerald-900/40 transition-all flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 text-sm tracking-wide">
                <span>UNISCITI SUBITO AL CANALE</span>
                <span>&rarr;</span>
            </a>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">100% Gratuito • Anonimo • Esci quando vuoi</p>
        </section>

        <!-- Come Funziona per i Cittadini -->
        <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400 uppercase text-center">Come funziona per i residenti</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-center">
                <div class="glass-card p-4 rounded-2xl space-y-1">
                    <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 font-bold rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-xs mb-2">1</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xs text-white">Segui il Canale</h3>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Iscriviti gratis su WhatsApp per attivare gli avvisi.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card p-4 rounded-2xl space-y-1">
                    <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 font-bold rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-xs mb-2">2</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xs text-white">Leggi la Notifica</h3>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Guarda cosa c'è di fresco o scontato vicino a te.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card p-4 rounded-2xl space-y-1">
                    <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 font-bold rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-xs mb-2">3</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xs text-white">Ritira al Banco</h3>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Vai in negozio, paga direttamente al banco e gusta!</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Sezione Vantaggi Commercianti -->
        <section class="glass-card border border-orange-500/30 rounded-3xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl">🏪</div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-white">Sei un Commerciante del Viale?</h2>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Aderisci gratuitamente al network locale</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300">
                <p class="flex items-center space-x-2"><span class="text-orange-400 font-bold">✓</span><span><strong>Zero Commissioni:</strong> Guadagno 100% tuo.</span></p>
                <p class="flex items-center space-x-2"><span class="text-orange-400 font-bold">✓</span><span><strong>Zero Burocrazia:</strong> Invii un messaggio e avvisi il quartiere.</span></p>
                <p class="flex items-center space-x-2"><span class="text-orange-400 font-bold">✓</span><span><strong>Azzera l'Invenduto:</strong> Monetizza le teglie serali.</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-2 text-center">
                <a href="https://wa.me/393421818159?text=Ciao!%20Ho%20un'attivit%C3%A0%20sul%20viale%20a%20Ostia%20e%20vorrei%20diventare%20Partner%20di%20Sfornato%20Ora." 
                   target="_blank" 
                   class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-amber-600 hover:from-orange-600 hover:to-amber-700 text-white font-extrabold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl text-xs transition-all shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/20 w-full">
                    <span>Diventa Partner del Viale</span>
                    <span>📲</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- FAQ Interattiva -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400 uppercase text-center">Domande Frequenti</h2>
            <details class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-4 cursor-pointer group">
                <summary class="font-bold text-xs text-white flex justify-between items-center list-none">
                    <span>È davvero gratuito per tutti?</span>
                    <span class="text-orange-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">&darr;</span>
                </summary>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
                    Sì, sia per i residenti che per i negozianti. Il progetto nasce per sostenere le attività locali e azzerare gli sprechi.
                </p>
            </details>
            <details class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-4 cursor-pointer group">
                <summary class="font-bold text-xs text-white flex justify-between items-center list-none">
                    <span>Come pago il prodotto?</span>
                    <span class="text-orange-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">&darr;</span>
                </summary>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
                    Paghi direttamente in negozio al momento del ritiro, in contanti o con carta.
                </p>
            </details>
        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="w-full py-6 px-6 border-t border-slate-900 text-center text-xs text-slate-500 mt-8 space-y-1">
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-400">Sfornato Ora • Ostia</p>
        <p class="text-[10px]">Un'iniziativa locale per la valorizzazione del commercio di vicinato.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>


